{
  "slug": "smarthealthconnect",
  "name": "Smarthealthconnect",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SmartHealthConnect turns Claude into a patient-facing health copilot. Six auto-discoverable skills invoke themselves based on natural prompts:\n\n• care-completion — tracks preventive screenings, referrals, and follow-ups against HEDIS and USPSTF quality measures. Triggers on \"what screenings am I due for\", \"show my care gaps\".\n• medication-refills — monitors refill windows, requests refills, and projects 90-day timelines. Triggers on \"refill my lisinopril\", \"which meds am I about to run out of\".\n• healthy-habits — a longitudinal health operating picture integrating sleep, exercise, medication adherence, vitals, and goal progress.\n• diet-exercise — logs activity and meals and analyzes correlations between exercise/diet and clinical outcomes (BP, HbA1c, weight).\n• kids-health — CDC immunization schedules, well-child visit cadence, and state-specific school health compliance.\n• research-monitor — filters bioRxiv / medRxiv preprints, ClinicalTrials.gov, and OpenFDA drug-safety signals to the patient's actual conditions and medications.\n\nBuilt on SMART on FHIR with PHI redaction, audit logging, and human-in-the-loop on write tools (add_journal_entry, generate_care_plan, generate_appointment_prep). Pairs cleanly with healthclaw-guardrails for the backend FHIR layer.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `care-completion` (Track care completion for preventive screenings, specialist referrals, and follow-up visits against HEDIS quality measures), `diet-exercise` (Log physical activity, meals, and wellness patterns, and analyze correlations between exercise/diet and clinical outcomes (BP, glucose, weight,…), `healthy-habits` (Maintain a longitudinal health operating picture integrating sleep, exercise, medication adherence, vital signs, and goal progress into one…), `kids-health` (Manage pediatric health against CDC immunization schedules, well-child visit cadence, and state school health compliance), `medication-refills` (Monitor medication refill windows, request refills proactively, and project prescription timelines so no dose gets missed), `research-monitor` (Monitor biomedical research preprints (bioRxiv, medRxiv), clinical trials (ClinicalTrials.gov), and FDA drug-safety signals (OpenFDA) filtered to the patient's…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `smarthealthconnect`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install smarthealthconnect@claude-community` from `aks129/SmartHealthConnect`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
